    "body": "Python 3.9 added the ability to generate per-attribute docstrings on attributes in slots that are parsed by `inspect.getdoc()` and `help` by passing a `dict` to `__slots__`.\r\n\r\nSince attrs can create slots, it would be great if there was a mechanism to follow this behavior.",
