    "body": "I'm writing [a Sphinx extension](https://codeberg.org/clayote/sphinx-attrs-cached-property-ext) to fix #1325. It does work, but it's brittle--if practically anything changes about the way cached properties of slots classes are made, my extension will break.\n\nI propose adding the currently private [`cached_properties`](https://github.com/python-attrs/attrs/blob/main/src/attr/_make.py#L913) dictionary to the public API, perhaps as an attribute like `__attrs_cached_properties__`.\n",
